, from 1951 to 2025. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years, and July to August in 22. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 36% of normal in October to November and 40% in March to April. So far in 2026 on the middle of the grids, January to February came in at 45% and April to May at 117%.</p>"}
